      "text": "Federal University of Amazonas\nThe Federal University of Amazonas ( Universidade Federal do Amazonas , UFAM ) is a public university located in Manaus , state of Amazonas , Brazil . It is the oldest university in Brazil and the largest university in the northern region of Brazil . It offers a wide array of degrees , with 645 research groups and 65 graduate courses ."
